<title>LITHUANIA: DANISH ODENSE MEETS BALTIC SHIPYARD MANAGEMENT.</title>
<headline>DANISH ODENSE MEETS BALTIC SHIPYARD MANAGEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Odense on Friday was meeting the management of Baltic Shipyard after the Danes earlier this week bought a 43 percent stake in the Lithuanian company.</p>
<p>An Odense official refused to say what the talks with the management were about but said a news release may be made in Denmark later today.</p>
<p>A Baltic Shipyard official said the meeting was to introduce the new investor in the company to the existing management.</p>
<p>Odense bought its stake in Baltic via purchases of shares on the Lithuanian stock exchange.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
